// c81 / D-PLUGIN1=B / D-PLUGIN-EXPORT1=A: the source of the sandboxed WASM
// Component Model module the host at `../run.jet` loads. No `export:`
// override here — the `.wit` world name defaults to the package name
// (`mathkit`, D-PLUGIN-EXPORT1=A). The compiler has no sandbox build target;
// the compiled `../mathkit.wasm` is committed so the golden test never needs a
// wasm32 toolchain to just RUN the example.
name: "mathkit"
version: "0.1.0"
description: "The source of the isolated WASM Component Model math library the sandbox_mathkit host loads."
license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
